1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:01,310
Welcome back!

2
00:00:01,310 --> 00:00:06,043
In this lesson, we'll log in and take
a guided tour of the Kyntlo interface.

3
00:00:06,043 --> 00:00:09,469
By the end, you'll know
exactly where everything lives,

4
00:00:09,469 --> 00:00:11,711
and the quickest ways to get around.

5
00:00:12,565 --> 00:00:18,006
To sign in, go to hub.kyntlo.ai, and log
in with the email address you used when

6
00:00:18,006 --> 00:00:18,958
you signed up.

7
00:00:18,958 --> 00:00:22,630
Bookmark the page, because
this is your new home base.

8
00:00:22,630 --> 00:00:27,459
If you ever forget your password,
use the reset link on the login page.

9
00:00:28,309 --> 00:00:30,953
Once you're in, you
land on your dashboard.

10
00:00:30,953 --> 00:00:34,951
It's a snapshot of how the business
is doing: your opportunities,

11
00:00:34,951 --> 00:00:37,841
revenue and conversion
rate, all on one screen.

12
00:00:37,841 --> 00:00:39,993
We'll read it properly in Module 2.

13
00:00:40,843 --> 00:00:42,924
Top left is your account switcher.

14
00:00:42,924 --> 00:00:45,495
It shows which business you're working in.

15
00:00:45,495 --> 00:00:49,473
If you run more than one location,
click it to jump between them.

16
00:00:49,473 --> 00:00:52,717
Everything you see, contacts,
calendars and settings,

17
00:00:52,717 --> 00:00:54,982
belongs to the account selected here.

18
00:00:55,832 --> 00:00:57,157
Just below is search.

19
00:00:57,157 --> 00:01:01,384
Click it, or press Ctrl + K from
anywhere, and start typing a name,

20
00:01:01,384 --> 00:01:02,772
email or phone number.

21
00:01:02,772 --> 00:01:06,684
Pick a result, and you're straight
into that contact's record.

22
00:01:07,535 --> 00:01:10,980
On the left is the sidebar,
where every tool lives.

23
00:01:10,980 --> 00:01:15,642
The everyday ones sit at the top:
conversations, calendars, contacts,

24
00:01:15,642 --> 00:01:17,466
opportunities and payments.

25
00:01:17,466 --> 00:01:23,005
Below the line are the tools that help you
grow: AI agents, marketing, automation,

26
00:01:23,005 --> 00:01:25,167
sites, reputation and reporting.

27
00:01:26,015 --> 00:01:29,671
Click any tool, and its own
tabs appear along the top bar.

28
00:01:29,671 --> 00:01:34,272
In Contacts, for example, you'll find
smart lists, bulk actions, restore,

29
00:01:34,272 --> 00:01:35,533
tasks and companies.

30
00:01:35,533 --> 00:01:39,441
Whenever you're looking for a
feature, check these tabs first.

31
00:01:40,291 --> 00:01:43,789
Conversations is your unified
inbox, with every email,

32
00:01:43,789 --> 00:01:47,092
text and social message in
one thread per customer.

33
00:01:47,092 --> 00:01:49,036
Calendars holds your bookings.

34
00:01:49,036 --> 00:01:52,598
And Opportunities shows your
sales pipeline as a board,

35
00:01:52,598 --> 00:01:55,578
so you can see every
deal and where it stands.

36
00:01:56,429 --> 00:01:58,027
Now the top right corner.

37
00:01:58,027 --> 00:02:03,332
The green phone button opens the dialer,
so you can call from your business number.

38
00:02:03,332 --> 00:02:08,509
The bell shows your notifications: new
leads, bookings, reviews and missed calls.

39
00:02:08,509 --> 00:02:11,066
And your initials open your own profile.

40
00:02:11,919 --> 00:02:15,051
Next to the bell is Ask AI,
your built-in assistant.

41
00:02:15,051 --> 00:02:19,268
Ask it about your business, like how
many new leads came in this week,

42
00:02:19,268 --> 00:02:23,002
or how to set something up, and
it answers using your account.

43
00:02:23,853 --> 00:02:25,382
Two more places to know.

44
00:02:25,382 --> 00:02:29,458
Launchpad, near the top of the
sidebar, is your setup checklist.

45
00:02:29,458 --> 00:02:33,981
And Settings, at the very bottom, is
where your business profile, team,

46
00:02:33,981 --> 00:02:36,274
phone numbers and integrations live.

47
00:02:36,274 --> 00:02:39,905
Opening Settings swaps the
sidebar for the settings menu.

48
00:02:39,905 --> 00:02:41,434
Click Go Back to return.

49
00:02:42,284 --> 00:02:43,338
Here's a pro tip.

50
00:02:43,338 --> 00:02:45,817
Get into the habit of pressing Ctrl + K.

51
00:02:45,817 --> 00:02:49,351
It's the quickest way to find
any contact, from any page,

52
00:02:49,351 --> 00:02:51,148
without touching the sidebar.

53
00:02:52,012 --> 00:02:52,890
That's the tour!

54
00:02:52,890 --> 00:02:55,251
Next up, we'll work
through your Launchpad,

55
00:02:55,251 --> 00:02:58,546
the checklist that gets your
account ready to capture leads.

56
00:02:58,546 --> 00:02:59,314
See you there.
